-     *             = 2^32 * 2^((n - d)/2^32 + d/2^32)
-     *             = 2^32 * 2^(d/2^32) * 2^((n - d)/2^32)
-     * Using x = n - d:
-     *     exp2(n) = 2^32 * 2^(d/2^32) * 2^(x/2^32)
